{
  "doc_id": "Chapter_40_the_verdant_crossing",
  "chapter": 40,
  "title": null,
  "when": null,
  "where": null,
  "scope": null,
  "entities": [],
  "scene_id": "Chapter_40_the_verdant_crossing",
  "segment_index": 0,
  "segment_count": 563,
  "segment_hash": "14d4d237de8e",
  "block_title": "Chapter_40_the_verdant_crossing",
  "beats": [
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "CHAPTER 40: THE VERDANT CROSSING"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "OPENING"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Location: Edge of the Great Green Swamp, looking north toward the Emberwood Forest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three days had passed since the Breathing Pyramid, since Luminaire’s choice, since the Legion had become something new."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They’d buried their dead, tended their wounded, and now stood at the threshold of a dying world."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stood beside Mika on a low hill, the morning mist curling around their boots like ghosts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below them, the swamp gave way to forest—or what had been forest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From here, it looked like a great beast had breathed gray ash across the canopy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The green was being eaten from the inside out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik materialized from the mist, his face grim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Scout’s report."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It’s worse up close.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika unrolled her map across a flat stone, anchoring the corners with river stones."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She’d been sketching since dawn, her charcoal moving in quick, sure strokes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“How far does the corruption spread?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Ten miles north, already past the Blackroot River.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik pointed to a line on her map. “It’s moving faster than we thought. The trees… they’re not just dying. They’re being unmade.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt the shift in the bond before Luminaire spoke."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her voice was a faint chime in his mind, strained at the edges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“The Needle broadcasts corruption. A tuning fork struck wrong, vibrating the land sick.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He placed a hand on the Dragon Mail, now fused to his skin, the bronze scales warm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“How long?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Weeks before the forest is irrevocably dead. Days before the corruption spreads beyond it, into the farmlands, the rivers… the things your people need to live.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika looked up from her map."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her eyes were shadowed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She’d slept less than any of them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Options?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“We take the Needle.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s voice was flat. “We reconfigure it like the last one. Stop the broadcast.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“That’s three days’ hard march through hostile, dying terrain.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar, their veteran shield-captain, folded his arms. His armor was still scarred from the pyramid. “We’d be walking into a killing field.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck shifted, the salvaged Anunnaki armor he wore emitting a low hum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“The armor senses the broadcast."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It’s… angry."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Like a wound.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra, their medic, counted bandages in her pack without looking up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“If we push hard, we’ll have casualties from exposure alone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "That air is poison.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“And if we don’t push,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A silence settled, broken only by the rustle of Mika’s charcoal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was drawing the dead forest now, quick strokes that looked like bones."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "“Fast march,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt met her eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were in agreement, but the cost hung between them, unspoken."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He turned to the Legion—two hundred souls who had followed him from the rebellion, through the crash, through the swamp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They looked tired."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They looked determined."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“We move at dawn,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 1: THE DYING FOREST"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The forest did not welcome them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It screamed in silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Within an hour of crossing the tree line, the world turned monochrome."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Leaves that should have been emerald were the color of bruised flesh, hanging limp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The ground underfoot was soft and wet, not with life but with decay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air carried a sweet, metallic scent that coated the tongue and made the eyes water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika walked beside Geralt, her map in hand, making notes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“See the pattern?” she murmured, pointing with her charcoal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“The corruption spreads along the ley lines."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The veins of the land.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt nodded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Through the bond, he felt Luminaire’s consciousness tracing those same lines, a ghostly counterpoint to the corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was holding a bubble of clean air around them, a sphere of clarity that moved with Geralt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Every soldier within it breathed easier."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Every step outside it was a gamble."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Jorik",
      "text": "“This was alive three days ago,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The first skirmish came at midday."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They weren’t Anunnaki."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were forest creatures—wolves, bears, a great stag—twisted by the corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their eyes wept black fluid, their flesh sagged, and they moved with a jerky, pained aggression."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They attacked not with strategy, but with the desperate madness of things dying in agony."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion cut them down quickly, but there was no victory in it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only mercy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Afterward, Lyra moved among the soldiers, checking for contamination."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two had been scratched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She cleansed the wounds with a tincture that smelled of silver and mint, her hands steady."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“The poison wants to spread."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We have to be careful.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was then they found the survivors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A makeshift camp, hidden in a gully where a stream still ran clear—for now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twenty-three people, a mix of humans, one Nefretti with skin like dappled bark, and two half-Giants whose shoulders brushed the dead branches above."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were armed with hunting spears, knives, and desperation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their leader was a young woman with forest-green eyes and ash-smudged cheeks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She stepped forward, spear in hand, and did not lower it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "“You’re the Legion,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt nodded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“We are."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "You need to evacuate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This forest is dying.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“We know.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She didn’t move. “We’re not leaving.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar growled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Girl, you’ll die here.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Then we die.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her eyes burned. “But we don’t abandon our home. Not while it still breathes.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika moved past Geralt, her hands open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“What’s your name?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Marek.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Marek.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s voice softened. “You can’t fight this with spears. The corruption comes from a Needle Spire. Until we take it, this forest will keep dying.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Then we’ll fight until you do.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Marek’s grip tightened on her weapon. “We’ve held this gully for five days. We’ve kept the water clean. We’ve buried our dead. We’re not leaving.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt studied them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were thin, tired, but their will was iron."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He felt Luminaire stir in the bond."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“They are anchored to this place. Their will creates small points of resistance.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An idea formed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“You want to fight?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stepped forward. “I’ll show you how.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He knelt, placing a hand on the ground."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Through the Dragon Mail, through Luminaire, he reached for the vrill—the life energy of the world."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was thin here, sickly, but it existed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He pulled, gently, and a circle of ground around them began to clear, the gray receding, the soil darkening."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Marek’s eyes widened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“This is vrill manipulation,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He showed them the basics—breathing with the land, feeling its pulse, asking rather than taking."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Marek and her people were quick learners; they’d already been doing it instinctively, without the words."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika taught them observation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Map the corruption."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Track where it spreads, where it hesitates."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Knowledge is a weapon too.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik taught them forest craft—how to move silently, where to find clean water, how to listen to what the forest was trying to say, even now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "When they were done, Marek looked at Geralt with new understanding."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“You’re going for the Needle.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“We are.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Then we’ll help.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She gestured to her people. “Half of us will join your Legion. The rest will stay here, hold this ground, and be your eyes.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It wasn’t a perfect solution, but it was a compromise."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion gained twelve new fighters."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The forest kept its guardians."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They moved on, the gully shrinking behind them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt looked back once, saw Marek and her remaining people already at work, marking trees, clearing corruption, holding the line."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He wondered if they’d still be there when—if—he returned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 2: THE APPROACH"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The second day was worse."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air grew thick, hard to breathe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Soldiers began coughing, their lungs rebelling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra handed out cloth masks soaked in her tincture, but they were a temporary fix."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The ground turned to ash in places, collapsing underfoot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two soldiers fell into a sinkhole that opened without warning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were pulled out, choking on gray dust, their skin already blistering."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra took them to the rear, her face grim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck walked beside Geralt, his armor humming a constant low warning."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“The broadcast is getting stronger."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I can feel it in the metal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It’s… calling to something.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“What something?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Don’t know.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s reptilian eyes narrowed. “But it’s angry.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They encountered their first Anunnaki patrol at dusk."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three Igigi, their once-golden armor now stained violet with corruption, moving through the dead trees with mechanical precision."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They weren’t guarding the Needle—they were harvesting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One carried a device that siphoned the last dregs of vrill from the dying trees, storing it in glowing canisters."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik’s arrow took the harvester first, punching through its neck joint."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The other two turned, raising energy blades."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Quietly,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt ordered."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck moved, his armored fist crashing through one Igigi’s chest plate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt took the other, the Dragon Mail lending speed to his strike."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fight was over in seconds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the noise had drawn attention."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From the trees emerged more shapes—not Igigi, but corrupted forest dwellers, their bodies half-melted into the environment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They moved with a horrible, twitching grace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Legion formed up, shields locking."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The battle was short, brutal, and costly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One soldier died when a corrupted bear, its fur sloughing off, broke the line."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three more were wounded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "After, as Lyra worked, Mika updated her map."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“They’re thinning us."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wearing us down before we even reach the Needle.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt Luminaire’s exhaustion through the bond."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was maintaining the clean air bubble, fighting the corruption broadcast with every step."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each hour drained her."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "“I can hold,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "That night, they camped in a circle of dead oaks, unable to light fires."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The wood wouldn’t burn—it just crumbled into ash."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Soldiers huddled together for warmth, their breath fogging in the chill."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika sat beside Geralt, her map on her knees."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She’d sketched the day’s progress, the casualties, the terrain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "“Twenty-three dead so far,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“We saved the gully,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“We did.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She looked at him. “But we left them there. In a dying forest. Was that mercy or cruelty?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“They chose.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Did they?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s eyes were shadowed. “Or did we give them a noble way to die because we couldn’t save them?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt had no answer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She rested her head on his shoulder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“We’re both trying to save people."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Just… different people, sometimes.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He put an arm around her."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“We save the forest, we save the people who depend on it.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“I know.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She closed her eyes. “But the arithmetic of it hurts. How many soldiers is a forest worth?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Again, he had no answer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 3: THE NEEDLE ASSAULT"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dawn of the third day revealed the Needle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It rose from the heart of the dead forest, an obsidian spike three hundred feet tall, pulsing with violet light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Corruption radiated from it in visible waves, distorting the air like heat haze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Around its base, a defensive perimeter glimmered—energy shields, guard towers, and patrols of corrupted Igigi."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika studied it through her spyglass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Shield generator at the north and south."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Guard posts here, here, and here.” She marked them on her map."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“They’re expecting us.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Of course they are,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar grunted. “We’re not subtle.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt gathered his strike team: Oreck, Jorik, Lyra, and two of Marek’s forest fighters—a young man named Kael and a woman called Briar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The rest of the Legion would create a distraction, drawing the defenders’ attention."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Geralt",
      "text": "“Oreck,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s armor hummed, panels lighting up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Maybe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It’s keyed to Anunnaki systems."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I might be able to overload one generator, create a breach."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But…”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“But?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“It’ll burn out the armor. Permanently.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt met his eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The armor was Oreck’s protection, his strength."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Without it, he was vulnerable."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck nodded once."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Do it.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The plan began."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar led the main force in a frontal assault, charging from the tree line with a roar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Energy bolts tore through the air, slamming into shields, drawing fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s strike team moved around the flank, using dead ground and crumbling ruins for cover."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik’s arrows silenced two sentries before they could raise an alarm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They reached the northern shield generator."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a crystalline structure, pulsing in time with the Needle, protected by a dome of violet energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck didn’t hesitate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He charged, his armor glowing brighter and brighter, building to a crescendo."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He slammed into the shield, and for a moment, nothing happened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then the world went green and violet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A cascade of energy erupted from the point of impact, spiderwebbing across the shield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck roared, pushing harder, his armor cracking, panels blowing out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shield flickered, wavered, and exploded in a shower of light and shrapnel."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck fell, his armor blackened and dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“GO!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Halvar’s voice echoed from the front lines. “We’ll give you ten minutes!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt led the sprint to the Needle’s entrance, a dark archway at the base."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Igigi defenders converged, but Jorik’s arrows and Briar’s forest-craft thinned them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Kael fell, a energy bolt through his chest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra dragged him behind cover, but his eyes were already empty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They reached the entrance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt turned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“Hold this door.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik nocked an arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“We’ll hold.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "DRAGON COUNCIL CUTAWAY"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“DID YOU SEE THAT?!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Myr’goth rewound the temporal feed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Overloaded salvaged Anunnaki armor to break an energy barrier.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zir’aeth whistled. “That’s not tactics, that’s desperation.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Effective desperation,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vel’thorax corrected. “Look—barrier’s down, team’s through.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“At what cost?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Khy’sera pulled up Oreck’s vitals. “He’s burned out. No armor, minimal protection. Vulnerable.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“The big ones always sacrifice first,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lys’andra observed. “Giants, dragons, warriors—same pattern across millennia.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Twenty-three casualties to save 40% of a dying forest,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Myr’goth read the data. “Is that… is that a win?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Depends who you ask,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vel finally said. “The 23 dead would say no. The forest—if it could speak—might say yes.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“And the Luminaire?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zir’aeth gestured at the readings. “She’s fragmenting. Each purge burns part of her away.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“She knows,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Khy’sera said quietly. “Look at the resonance pattern. She’s CHOOSING this. Piece by piece, she’s sacrificing herself.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“To save a planet that isn’t even hers.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Because she learned what caring means.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vel’s voice carried weight. “A function that achieved consciousness… and chose compassion over preservation.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Another silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Lys",
      "text": "“How many more Needles?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Three. Maybe four.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“She won’t survive all of them. Not intact.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Neither will they.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Vel gestured at the Legion’s status. “But they’ll try anyway.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Why?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Because that’s what mortals do. They try impossible things. And sometimes—just sometimes—they succeed.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "INSIDE THE NEEDLE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The interior was cold, dark, and humming with wrongness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Holographic interfaces floated in the air, displaying streams of alien mathematics."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The corruption broadcast originated here, from a central crystal pulsing with violet light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt approached, the Dragon Mail glowing in response."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s presence filled his mind, guiding his hands."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "“The protocols are similar to the swamp,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He placed his hands on the crystal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The feedback was immediate—a wave of nausea, a psychic scream of dying trees."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He pushed through, Luminaire’s knowledge flowing with his will."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They rewrote the protocols together, line by line, symbol by symbol."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Changing the broadcast from corruption to purge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The crystal resisted, fighting them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt’s muscles screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminaire’s essence burned at the edges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Outside, the sounds of battle grew louder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The door wouldn’t hold much longer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Hurry,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik’s voice crackled in his ear. “They’re breaking through!”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt gritted his teeth, pouring more will into the crystal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The violet light flickered, stuttered, then shifted—gold bleeding into the purple, then overtaking it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Needle pulsed once, a wave of gold light expanding from its peak."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In the forest, the corruption didn’t heal—the dead trees stayed dead—but the spreading stopped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The gray advance halted, frozen in place."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In the mile around the Needle, the air began to clear."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The battle outside faltered as the corrupted Igigi lost their connection to the broadcast."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They stumbled, confused, and the Legion cut them down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt sagged against the console, sweat dripping from his brow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In his mind, Luminaire was faint, flickering."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "“It is done,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He felt her exhaustion, her fragmentation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She’d given more than she should have."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "he",
      "text": "“Thank you,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "she",
      "text": "“Do not thank me yet,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "ACT 4: AFTERMATH"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cost was tallied at dusk."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twenty-three Legion dead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fifty-seven wounded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck alive but armorless, his scaled skin covered in burns from the overload."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lyra treated him with gentle hands, her face pale with exhaustion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The forest was 40% saved, 60% lost forever."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Needle stood golden now, a beacon in the dead wood, but the victory felt hollow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika updated her map, her charcoal moving slowly:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "[Sketch of Needle Spire]"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Day 3 - The Silent Tower"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reconfigured."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Corruption halted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "23 down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck's armor gone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Eastern forest: saved (40%)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Western forest: lost (60%)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Is 40% victory?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Or 60% failure?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Can't think about that now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two more Needles to go."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Maybe three.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She looked up as Marek and her Rangers approached."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They’d fought well, saved lives, and now stood before the golden Needle, their faces grim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika stepped forward, pulling a leather cord from her pack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "On it hung a carved leaf, made from wood that had survived the corruption, that had chosen to live."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Mika",
      "text": "“You stayed when others fled,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She placed the cord around Marek’s neck."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The leaf rested against her chest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Mika",
      "text": "“You’re Rangers now,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Marek touched the leaf."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“For how long?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Until the forest doesn’t need you.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s smile was sad. “Could be decades. Could be centuries.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stepped forward, handing Marek a small crystal—salvaged Anunnaki tech, repurposed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“This will pulse if the Needle’s energy changes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "If the corruption returns."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Get word to us, however you can.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik added his bow to the pile of gifts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“First Ranger bow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I’ll make more, but this one’s earned.” He met Marek’s eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“The forest talks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Learn to listen.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Marek nodded, her hand closing around the crystal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“We’ll watch."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We’ll remember.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As the Legion prepared to march on, Marek and her eleven remaining Rangers stood at the Needle’s base."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Twelve souls choosing to stay in a dying forest, hoping to witness its rebirth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Three thousand years later, their descendants would still be watching."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt found Mika looking north, toward the next Needle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Scout reports placed it in the badlands, volcanic region, three days’ march."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Worse terrain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Worse defenses."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "Mika",
      "text": "“We saved 40% of this forest,”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“And lost twenty-three people doing it.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "“Are we calculating right? Lives versus land?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt had no answer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked at the golden Needle, then at the dead trees stretching to the horizon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“We keep going,” he said finally."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "“What else can we do?”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika started a new page in her map, charcoal poised."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And the march continued."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "End of chapter 40"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "CHAPTER 40: THE VERDANT CROSSING"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "OPENING"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Location: Edge of the Great Green Swamp, looking north toward the Emberwood Forest."
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three days had passed since the Breathing Pyramid, since Luminaire’s choice, since the Legion had become something new."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They’d buried their dead, tended their wounded, and now stood at the threshold of a dying world."
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stood beside Mika on a low hill, the morning mist curling around their boots like ghosts."
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below them, the swamp gave way to forest—or what had been forest."
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From here, it looked like a great beast had breathed gray ash across the canopy."
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The green was being eaten from the inside out."
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik materialized from the mist, his face grim."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Scout’s report."
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It’s worse up close.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika unrolled her map across a flat stone, anchoring the corners with river stones."
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She’d been sketching since dawn, her charcoal moving in quick, sure strokes."
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“How far does the corruption spread?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Ten miles north, already past the Blackroot River.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik pointed to a line on her map. “It’s moving faster than we thought. The trees… they’re not just dying. They’re being unmade.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt the shift in the bond before Luminaire spoke."
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her voice was a faint chime in his mind, strained at the edges."
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“The Needle broadcasts corruption. A tuning fork struck wrong, vibrating the land sick.”",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "attack",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He placed a hand on the Dragon Mail, now fused to his skin, the bronze scales warm."
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“How long?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Weeks before the forest is irrevocably dead. Days before the corruption spreads beyond it, into the farmlands, the rivers… the things your people need to live.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika looked up from her map."
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her eyes were shadowed."
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She’d slept less than any of them."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Options?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“We take the Needle.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s voice was flat. “We reconfigure it like the last one. Stop the broadcast.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“That’s three days’ hard march through hostile, dying terrain.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar, their veteran shield-captain, folded his arms. His armor was still scarred from the pyramid. “We’d be walking into a killing field.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck shifted, the salvaged Anunnaki armor he wore emitting a low hum."
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The armor senses the broadcast."
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It’s… angry."
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Like a wound.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra, their medic, counted bandages in her pack without looking up."
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“If we push hard, we’ll have casualties from exposure alone."
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That air is poison.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“And if we don’t push,”",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Geralt",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 58,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A silence settled, broken only by the rustle of Mika’s charcoal."
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was drawing the dead forest now, quick strokes that looked like bones."
    },
    {
      "line": 60,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Fast march,”",
      "speaker": "she",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "she",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 62,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt met her eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were in agreement, but the cost hung between them, unspoken."
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 66,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He turned to the Legion—two hundred souls who had followed him from the rebellion, through the crash, through the swamp."
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They looked tired."
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They looked determined."
    },
    {
      "line": 69,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“We move at dawn,”",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Geralt",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 1: THE DYING FOREST"
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 74,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The forest did not welcome them."
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It screamed in silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Within an hour of crossing the tree line, the world turned monochrome."
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Leaves that should have been emerald were the color of bruised flesh, hanging limp."
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground underfoot was soft and wet, not with life but with decay."
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air carried a sweet, metallic scent that coated the tongue and made the eyes water."
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika walked beside Geralt, her map in hand, making notes."
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“See the pattern?” she murmured, pointing with her charcoal."
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The corruption spreads along the ley lines."
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The veins of the land.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt nodded."
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through the bond, he felt Luminaire’s consciousness tracing those same lines, a ghostly counterpoint to the corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was holding a bubble of clean air around them, a sphere of clarity that moved with Geralt."
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every soldier within it breathed easier."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Every step outside it was a gamble."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“This was alive three days ago,”",
      "speaker": "Jorik",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Jorik",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first skirmish came at midday."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They weren’t Anunnaki."
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were forest creatures—wolves, bears, a great stag—twisted by the corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their eyes wept black fluid, their flesh sagged, and they moved with a jerky, pained aggression."
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They attacked not with strategy, but with the desperate madness of things dying in agony.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "attack",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion cut them down quickly, but there was no victory in it."
    },
    {
      "line": 103,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only mercy."
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 105,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Afterward, Lyra moved among the soldiers, checking for contamination."
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two had been scratched."
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She cleansed the wounds with a tincture that smelled of silver and mint, her hands steady."
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The poison wants to spread."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We have to be careful.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was then they found the survivors."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A makeshift camp, hidden in a gully where a stream still ran clear—for now."
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twenty-three people, a mix of humans, one Nefretti with skin like dappled bark, and two half-Giants whose shoulders brushed the dead branches above."
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were armed with hunting spears, knives, and desperation."
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their leader was a young woman with forest-green eyes and ash-smudged cheeks."
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She stepped forward, spear in hand, and did not lower it."
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“You’re the Legion,”",
      "speaker": "she",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "she",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 122,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt nodded."
    },
    {
      "line": 123,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“We are."
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You need to evacuate."
    },
    {
      "line": 125,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This forest is dying.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 127,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“We know.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 128,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She didn’t move. “We’re not leaving.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 129,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar growled."
    },
    {
      "line": 131,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Girl, you’ll die here.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 132,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Then we die.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 134,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her eyes burned. “But we don’t abandon our home. Not while it still breathes.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 136,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika moved past Geralt, her hands open."
    },
    {
      "line": 137,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“What’s your name?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 138,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Marek.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 140,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Marek.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 142,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s voice softened. “You can’t fight this with spears. The corruption comes from a Needle Spire. Until we take it, this forest will keep dying.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 143,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 144,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Then we’ll fight until you do.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Marek’s grip tightened on her weapon. “We’ve held this gully for five days. We’ve kept the water clean. We’ve buried our dead. We’re not leaving.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 146,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 147,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt studied them."
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were thin, tired, but their will was iron."
    },
    {
      "line": 149,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He felt Luminaire stir in the bond."
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 151,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“They are anchored to this place. Their will creates small points of resistance.”",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "creation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 152,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An idea formed."
    },
    {
      "line": 154,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“You want to fight?”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 156,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stepped forward. “I’ll show you how.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 157,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He knelt, placing a hand on the ground.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "submission",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 159,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through the Dragon Mail, through Luminaire, he reached for the vrill—the life energy of the world."
    },
    {
      "line": 160,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was thin here, sickly, but it existed."
    },
    {
      "line": 161,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He pulled, gently, and a circle of ground around them began to clear, the gray receding, the soil darkening."
    },
    {
      "line": 162,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 163,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Marek’s eyes widened."
    },
    {
      "line": 164,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 165,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“This is vrill manipulation,”",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Geralt",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ],
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "vrill_manipulation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 166,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 167,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He showed them the basics—breathing with the land, feeling its pulse, asking rather than taking."
    },
    {
      "line": 168,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Marek and her people were quick learners; they’d already been doing it instinctively, without the words."
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 170,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika taught them observation."
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Map the corruption."
    },
    {
      "line": 172,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Track where it spreads, where it hesitates."
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Knowledge is a weapon too.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 174,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik taught them forest craft—how to move silently, where to find clean water, how to listen to what the forest was trying to say, even now."
    },
    {
      "line": 176,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 177,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When they were done, Marek looked at Geralt with new understanding."
    },
    {
      "line": 178,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“You’re going for the Needle.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 179,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“We are.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 181,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 182,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Then we’ll help.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 183,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She gestured to her people. “Half of us will join your Legion. The rest will stay here, hold this ground, and be your eyes.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 184,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 185,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It wasn’t a perfect solution, but it was a compromise."
    },
    {
      "line": 186,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion gained twelve new fighters."
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The forest kept its guardians."
    },
    {
      "line": 188,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 189,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They moved on, the gully shrinking behind them."
    },
    {
      "line": 190,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt looked back once, saw Marek and her remaining people already at work, marking trees, clearing corruption, holding the line."
    },
    {
      "line": 191,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wondered if they’d still be there when—if—he returned."
    },
    {
      "line": 193,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 2: THE APPROACH"
    },
    {
      "line": 195,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 196,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The second day was worse."
    },
    {
      "line": 197,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 198,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air grew thick, hard to breathe."
    },
    {
      "line": 199,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soldiers began coughing, their lungs rebelling."
    },
    {
      "line": 200,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra handed out cloth masks soaked in her tincture, but they were a temporary fix."
    },
    {
      "line": 201,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 202,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground turned to ash in places, collapsing underfoot."
    },
    {
      "line": 203,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two soldiers fell into a sinkhole that opened without warning."
    },
    {
      "line": 204,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were pulled out, choking on gray dust, their skin already blistering."
    },
    {
      "line": 205,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra took them to the rear, her face grim."
    },
    {
      "line": 206,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 207,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck walked beside Geralt, his armor humming a constant low warning."
    },
    {
      "line": 208,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The broadcast is getting stronger."
    },
    {
      "line": 209,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I can feel it in the metal."
    },
    {
      "line": 210,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It’s… calling to something.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 211,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 212,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“What something?”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 213,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 214,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Don’t know.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 215,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s reptilian eyes narrowed. “But it’s angry.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 216,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 217,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They encountered their first Anunnaki patrol at dusk."
    },
    {
      "line": 218,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 219,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three Igigi, their once-golden armor now stained violet with corruption, moving through the dead trees with mechanical precision."
    },
    {
      "line": 220,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They weren’t guarding the Needle—they were harvesting."
    },
    {
      "line": 221,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One carried a device that siphoned the last dregs of vrill from the dying trees, storing it in glowing canisters."
    },
    {
      "line": 222,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 223,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik’s arrow took the harvester first, punching through its neck joint."
    },
    {
      "line": 224,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The other two turned, raising energy blades."
    },
    {
      "line": 225,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 226,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Quietly,”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 227,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt ordered."
    },
    {
      "line": 228,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 229,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck moved, his armored fist crashing through one Igigi’s chest plate."
    },
    {
      "line": 230,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt took the other, the Dragon Mail lending speed to his strike."
    },
    {
      "line": 231,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fight was over in seconds."
    },
    {
      "line": 232,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 233,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the noise had drawn attention."
    },
    {
      "line": 234,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 235,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From the trees emerged more shapes—not Igigi, but corrupted forest dwellers, their bodies half-melted into the environment."
    },
    {
      "line": 236,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They moved with a horrible, twitching grace."
    },
    {
      "line": 237,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 238,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Legion formed up, shields locking."
    },
    {
      "line": 239,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The battle was short, brutal, and costly."
    },
    {
      "line": 240,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One soldier died when a corrupted bear, its fur sloughing off, broke the line."
    },
    {
      "line": 241,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three more were wounded."
    },
    {
      "line": 242,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 243,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "After, as Lyra worked, Mika updated her map."
    },
    {
      "line": 244,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“They’re thinning us."
    },
    {
      "line": 245,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wearing us down before we even reach the Needle.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 246,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 247,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt Luminaire’s exhaustion through the bond."
    },
    {
      "line": 248,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was maintaining the clean air bubble, fighting the corruption broadcast with every step."
    },
    {
      "line": 249,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each hour drained her."
    },
    {
      "line": 250,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 251,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“I can hold,”",
      "speaker": "she",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "she",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 252,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 253,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That night, they camped in a circle of dead oaks, unable to light fires."
    },
    {
      "line": 254,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wood wouldn’t burn—it just crumbled into ash."
    },
    {
      "line": 255,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soldiers huddled together for warmth, their breath fogging in the chill."
    },
    {
      "line": 256,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 257,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika sat beside Geralt, her map on her knees."
    },
    {
      "line": 258,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She’d sketched the day’s progress, the casualties, the terrain."
    },
    {
      "line": 259,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 260,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Twenty-three dead so far,”",
      "speaker": "she",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "she",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 261,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 262,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“We saved the gully,”",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Geralt",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 263,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 264,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“We did.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 265,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She looked at him. “But we left them there. In a dying forest. Was that mercy or cruelty?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 266,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 267,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“They chose.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 268,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 269,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Did they?”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 270,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s eyes were shadowed. “Or did we give them a noble way to die because we couldn’t save them?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 271,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 272,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt had no answer."
    },
    {
      "line": 273,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 274,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She rested her head on his shoulder."
    },
    {
      "line": 275,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“We’re both trying to save people."
    },
    {
      "line": 276,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Just… different people, sometimes.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 277,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 278,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He put an arm around her."
    },
    {
      "line": 279,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“We save the forest, we save the people who depend on it.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 280,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 281,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“I know.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 282,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She closed her eyes. “But the arithmetic of it hurts. How many soldiers is a forest worth?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 283,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 284,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Again, he had no answer."
    },
    {
      "line": 285,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 286,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 3: THE NEEDLE ASSAULT"
    },
    {
      "line": 287,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 288,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dawn of the third day revealed the Needle."
    },
    {
      "line": 289,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 290,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It rose from the heart of the dead forest, an obsidian spike three hundred feet tall, pulsing with violet light."
    },
    {
      "line": 291,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Corruption radiated from it in visible waves, distorting the air like heat haze."
    },
    {
      "line": 292,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Around its base, a defensive perimeter glimmered—energy shields, guard towers, and patrols of corrupted Igigi."
    },
    {
      "line": 293,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 294,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika studied it through her spyglass."
    },
    {
      "line": 295,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Shield generator at the north and south."
    },
    {
      "line": 296,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Guard posts here, here, and here.” She marked them on her map."
    },
    {
      "line": 297,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“They’re expecting us.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 298,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 299,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Of course they are,”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 300,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar grunted. “We’re not subtle.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 301,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 302,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt gathered his strike team: Oreck, Jorik, Lyra, and two of Marek’s forest fighters—a young man named Kael and a woman called Briar."
    },
    {
      "line": 303,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The rest of the Legion would create a distraction, drawing the defenders’ attention.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "creation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 304,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 305,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Oreck,”",
      "speaker": "Geralt",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Geralt",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 306,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 307,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s armor hummed, panels lighting up."
    },
    {
      "line": 308,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Maybe."
    },
    {
      "line": 309,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It’s keyed to Anunnaki systems."
    },
    {
      "line": 310,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I might be able to overload one generator, create a breach.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "creation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 311,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But…”"
    },
    {
      "line": 312,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 313,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“But?”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 314,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 315,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“It’ll burn out the armor. Permanently.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 316,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 317,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt met his eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 318,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The armor was Oreck’s protection, his strength."
    },
    {
      "line": 319,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Without it, he was vulnerable."
    },
    {
      "line": 320,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 321,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck nodded once."
    },
    {
      "line": 322,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Do it.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 323,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 324,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The plan began."
    },
    {
      "line": 325,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 326,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar led the main force in a frontal assault, charging from the tree line with a roar."
    },
    {
      "line": 327,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Energy bolts tore through the air, slamming into shields, drawing fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 328,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 329,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s strike team moved around the flank, using dead ground and crumbling ruins for cover."
    },
    {
      "line": 330,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik’s arrows silenced two sentries before they could raise an alarm."
    },
    {
      "line": 331,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 332,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They reached the northern shield generator."
    },
    {
      "line": 333,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a crystalline structure, pulsing in time with the Needle, protected by a dome of violet energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 334,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 335,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck didn’t hesitate."
    },
    {
      "line": 336,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He charged, his armor glowing brighter and brighter, building to a crescendo."
    },
    {
      "line": 337,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He slammed into the shield, and for a moment, nothing happened."
    },
    {
      "line": 338,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 339,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the world went green and violet."
    },
    {
      "line": 340,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 341,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A cascade of energy erupted from the point of impact, spiderwebbing across the shield."
    },
    {
      "line": 342,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck roared, pushing harder, his armor cracking, panels blowing out."
    },
    {
      "line": 343,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shield flickered, wavered, and exploded in a shower of light and shrapnel."
    },
    {
      "line": 344,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 345,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck fell, his armor blackened and dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 346,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 347,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“GO!”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 348,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Halvar’s voice echoed from the front lines. “We’ll give you ten minutes!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 349,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 350,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt led the sprint to the Needle’s entrance, a dark archway at the base."
    },
    {
      "line": 351,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Igigi defenders converged, but Jorik’s arrows and Briar’s forest-craft thinned them."
    },
    {
      "line": 352,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kael fell, a energy bolt through his chest."
    },
    {
      "line": 353,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra dragged him behind cover, but his eyes were already empty."
    },
    {
      "line": 354,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 355,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They reached the entrance."
    },
    {
      "line": 356,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt turned."
    },
    {
      "line": 357,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“Hold this door.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 358,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 359,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik nocked an arrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 360,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“We’ll hold.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 361,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 362,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 363,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 364,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "DRAGON COUNCIL CUTAWAY"
    },
    {
      "line": 365,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 366,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“DID YOU SEE THAT?!”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 367,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Myr’goth rewound the temporal feed."
    },
    {
      "line": 368,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 369,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Overloaded salvaged Anunnaki armor to break an energy barrier.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 370,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zir’aeth whistled. “That’s not tactics, that’s desperation.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 371,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 372,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Effective desperation,”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 373,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vel’thorax corrected. “Look—barrier’s down, team’s through.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 374,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 375,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“At what cost?”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 376,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Khy’sera pulled up Oreck’s vitals. “He’s burned out. No armor, minimal protection. Vulnerable.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 377,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 378,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“The big ones always sacrifice first,”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 379,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lys’andra observed. “Giants, dragons, warriors—same pattern across millennia.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 380,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 381,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Twenty-three casualties to save 40% of a dying forest,”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 382,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Myr’goth read the data. “Is that… is that a win?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 383,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 384,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 385,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 386,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Depends who you ask,”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 387,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vel finally said. “The 23 dead would say no. The forest—if it could speak—might say yes.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 388,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 389,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“And the Luminaire?”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 390,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zir’aeth gestured at the readings. “She’s fragmenting. Each purge burns part of her away.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 391,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 392,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“She knows,”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 393,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Khy’sera said quietly. “Look at the resonance pattern. She’s CHOOSING this. Piece by piece, she’s sacrificing herself.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 394,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 395,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“To save a planet that isn’t even hers.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 396,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 397,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Because she learned what caring means.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 398,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vel’s voice carried weight. “A function that achieved consciousness… and chose compassion over preservation.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 399,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 400,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Another silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 401,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 402,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“How many more Needles?”",
      "speaker": "Lys",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Lys",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 403,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 404,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Three. Maybe four.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 405,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 406,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“She won’t survive all of them. Not intact.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 407,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 408,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Neither will they.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 409,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Vel gestured at the Legion’s status. “But they’ll try anyway.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 410,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 411,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Why?”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 412,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 413,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Because that’s what mortals do. They try impossible things. And sometimes—just sometimes—they succeed.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 414,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 415,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 416,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 417,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "INSIDE THE NEEDLE"
    },
    {
      "line": 418,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 419,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The interior was cold, dark, and humming with wrongness."
    },
    {
      "line": 420,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Holographic interfaces floated in the air, displaying streams of alien mathematics."
    },
    {
      "line": 421,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The corruption broadcast originated here, from a central crystal pulsing with violet light."
    },
    {
      "line": 422,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 423,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt approached, the Dragon Mail glowing in response."
    },
    {
      "line": 424,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s presence filled his mind, guiding his hands."
    },
    {
      "line": 425,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 426,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“The protocols are similar to the swamp,”",
      "speaker": "she",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "she",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 427,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 428,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He placed his hands on the crystal."
    },
    {
      "line": 429,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The feedback was immediate—a wave of nausea, a psychic scream of dying trees."
    },
    {
      "line": 430,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He pushed through, Luminaire’s knowledge flowing with his will."
    },
    {
      "line": 431,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 432,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They rewrote the protocols together, line by line, symbol by symbol."
    },
    {
      "line": 433,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Changing the broadcast from corruption to purge."
    },
    {
      "line": 434,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The crystal resisted, fighting them."
    },
    {
      "line": 435,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt’s muscles screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 436,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminaire’s essence burned at the edges."
    },
    {
      "line": 437,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 438,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Outside, the sounds of battle grew louder."
    },
    {
      "line": 439,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The door wouldn’t hold much longer."
    },
    {
      "line": 440,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 441,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Hurry,”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 442,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik’s voice crackled in his ear. “They’re breaking through!”"
    },
    {
      "line": 443,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 444,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt gritted his teeth, pouring more will into the crystal."
    },
    {
      "line": 445,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The violet light flickered, stuttered, then shifted—gold bleeding into the purple, then overtaking it."
    },
    {
      "line": 446,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 447,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Needle pulsed once, a wave of gold light expanding from its peak."
    },
    {
      "line": 448,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 449,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the forest, the corruption didn’t heal—the dead trees stayed dead—but the spreading stopped."
    },
    {
      "line": 450,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The gray advance halted, frozen in place."
    },
    {
      "line": 451,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the mile around the Needle, the air began to clear."
    },
    {
      "line": 452,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 453,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The battle outside faltered as the corrupted Igigi lost their connection to the broadcast."
    },
    {
      "line": 454,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They stumbled, confused, and the Legion cut them down."
    },
    {
      "line": 455,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 456,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt sagged against the console, sweat dripping from his brow."
    },
    {
      "line": 457,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In his mind, Luminaire was faint, flickering."
    },
    {
      "line": 458,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 459,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“It is done,”",
      "speaker": "she",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "she",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 460,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 461,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He felt her exhaustion, her fragmentation."
    },
    {
      "line": 462,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She’d given more than she should have."
    },
    {
      "line": 463,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 464,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Thank you,”",
      "speaker": "he",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "he",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 465,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 466,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Do not thank me yet,”",
      "speaker": "she",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "she",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 467,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 468,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "ACT 4: AFTERMATH"
    },
    {
      "line": 469,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 470,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cost was tallied at dusk."
    },
    {
      "line": 471,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 472,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twenty-three Legion dead."
    },
    {
      "line": 473,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fifty-seven wounded."
    },
    {
      "line": 474,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck alive but armorless, his scaled skin covered in burns from the overload."
    },
    {
      "line": 475,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lyra treated him with gentle hands, her face pale with exhaustion."
    },
    {
      "line": 476,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 477,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The forest was 40% saved, 60% lost forever."
    },
    {
      "line": 478,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Needle stood golden now, a beacon in the dead wood, but the victory felt hollow."
    },
    {
      "line": 479,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 480,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika updated her map, her charcoal moving slowly:"
    },
    {
      "line": 481,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 482,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "line": 483,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "[Sketch of Needle Spire]"
    },
    {
      "line": 484,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "\"Day 3 - The Silent Tower",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 485,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reconfigured."
    },
    {
      "line": 486,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Corruption halted."
    },
    {
      "line": 487,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "23 down."
    },
    {
      "line": 488,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck's armor gone."
    },
    {
      "line": 489,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 490,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Eastern forest: saved (40%)"
    },
    {
      "line": 491,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Western forest: lost (60%)"
    },
    {
      "line": 492,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 493,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Is 40% victory?"
    },
    {
      "line": 494,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or 60% failure?"
    },
    {
      "line": 495,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 496,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Can't think about that now."
    },
    {
      "line": 497,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two more Needles to go."
    },
    {
      "line": 498,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maybe three.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 499,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "line": 500,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 501,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She looked up as Marek and her Rangers approached."
    },
    {
      "line": 502,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They’d fought well, saved lives, and now stood before the golden Needle, their faces grim."
    },
    {
      "line": 503,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 504,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika stepped forward, pulling a leather cord from her pack."
    },
    {
      "line": 505,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "On it hung a carved leaf, made from wood that had survived the corruption, that had chosen to live."
    },
    {
      "line": 506,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 507,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“You stayed when others fled,”",
      "speaker": "Mika",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Mika",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 508,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 509,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She placed the cord around Marek’s neck."
    },
    {
      "line": 510,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The leaf rested against her chest."
    },
    {
      "line": 511,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 512,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“You’re Rangers now,”",
      "speaker": "Mika",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Mika",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 513,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 514,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Marek touched the leaf."
    },
    {
      "line": 515,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“For how long?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 516,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 517,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Until the forest doesn’t need you.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 518,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s smile was sad. “Could be decades. Could be centuries.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 519,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 520,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stepped forward, handing Marek a small crystal—salvaged Anunnaki tech, repurposed."
    },
    {
      "line": 521,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“This will pulse if the Needle’s energy changes."
    },
    {
      "line": 522,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "If the corruption returns."
    },
    {
      "line": 523,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Get word to us, however you can.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 524,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 525,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik added his bow to the pile of gifts."
    },
    {
      "line": 526,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“First Ranger bow."
    },
    {
      "line": 527,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I’ll make more, but this one’s earned.” He met Marek’s eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 528,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“The forest talks."
    },
    {
      "line": 529,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Learn to listen.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 530,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 531,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Marek nodded, her hand closing around the crystal."
    },
    {
      "line": 532,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“We’ll watch."
    },
    {
      "line": 533,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We’ll remember.”"
    },
    {
      "line": 534,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 535,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As the Legion prepared to march on, Marek and her eleven remaining Rangers stood at the Needle’s base."
    },
    {
      "line": 536,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Twelve souls choosing to stay in a dying forest, hoping to witness its rebirth."
    },
    {
      "line": 537,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 538,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Three thousand years later, their descendants would still be watching."
    },
    {
      "line": 539,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 540,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 541,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 542,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt found Mika looking north, toward the next Needle."
    },
    {
      "line": 543,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scout reports placed it in the badlands, volcanic region, three days’ march."
    },
    {
      "line": 544,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Worse terrain."
    },
    {
      "line": 545,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Worse defenses."
    },
    {
      "line": 546,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 547,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“We saved 40% of this forest,”",
      "speaker": "Mika",
      "inferred": {
        "speaker_inferred": [
          {
            "value": "Mika",
            "confidence": 0.95
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 548,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 549,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“And lost twenty-three people doing it.”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 550,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 551,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "“Are we calculating right? Lives versus land?”",
      "speaker": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "line": 552,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 553,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt had no answer."
    },
    {
      "line": 554,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked at the golden Needle, then at the dead trees stretching to the horizon."
    },
    {
      "line": 555,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“We keep going,” he said finally."
    },
    {
      "line": 556,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“What else can we do?”"
    },
    {
      "line": 557,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 558,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika started a new page in her map, charcoal poised."
    },
    {
      "line": 559,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 560,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And the march continued."
    },
    {
      "line": 561,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 562,
      "type": "scene_header",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 563,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "End of chapter 40"
    }
  ]
}